{
  "id": "6a8138174d5599853bb717ab",
  "title": "証券取引市場スケジュール",
  "created": 1786853639,
  "updated": 1786858496,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8138174d5599853bb717ab",
      "text": "証券取引市場スケジュール",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786853639,
      "updated": 1786853639
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813cbc00000000008bab4a",
      "text": "スケジュール周りの用語を集めたい",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854589,
      "updated": 1786854619
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813df700000000008bab53",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854903,
      "updated": 1786854907
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813df800000000008bab54",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854905,
      "updated": 1786854905
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81390800000000008bab42",
      "text": "平日（月・火・水・木・金）　除：祝日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786853641,
      "updated": 1786854559
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81392400000000008bab44",
      "text": "\t前場：9時00分～11時30分\t2時間30分",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786853668,
      "updated": 1786853739
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81392f00000000008bab45",
      "text": "\t後場：12時30分～15時00分\t2時間30分",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786853679,
      "updated": 1786853746
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81391e00000000008bab43",
      "text": "\t前日の終値と当日の始値にズレが生じることがある。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786853662,
      "updated": 1786854097
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813dfd00000000008bab55",
      "text": "\t寄付：前場・後場の最初の取引",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854910,
      "updated": 1786855037
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813e0500000000008bab57",
      "text": "\t引け：前場・後場の最後の取引",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854918,
      "updated": 1786855042
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813f0d00000000008bab59",
      "text": "\t\t引け直前の取引は取引価格決定の際の優先順序が変わる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855181,
      "updated": 1786855231
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813f4100000000008bab5a",
      "text": "\t\tすべての注文が同時に発注されたものとして[価格優先の原則]に従って行われる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855234,
      "updated": 1786855309
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813e8700000000008bab58",
      "text": "\t大引け：その日の最後の取引",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855048,
      "updated": 1786855061
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813ac300000000008bab46",
      "text": "休日・祝日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854084,
      "updated": 1786854585
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813ca500000000008bab48",
      "text": "\t休場",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854566,
      "updated": 1786854572
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813cad00000000008bab49",
      "text": "\t取引がない。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854573,
      "updated": 1786854578
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813ca300000000008bab47",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854564,
      "updated": 1786854564
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813de300000000008bab50",
      "text": "四半期決算：3ヶ月毎に企業の決算が行われ、決算報告書が出る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786854884,
      "updated": 1786855526
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81404d00000000008bab5c",
      "text": "\tQ1：第1四半期",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855502,
      "updated": 1786855563
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81409c00000000008bab61",
      "text": "\t\t4月始まり企業なら4月〜6月",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855580,
      "updated": 1786855581
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81408a00000000008bab5d",
      "text": "\tQ2：第2四半期",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855563,
      "updated": 1786855569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8140a200000000008bab62",
      "text": "\t\t4月始まり企業なら7月〜9月（中間決算）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855586,
      "updated": 1786855587
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81408a00000000008bab5e",
      "text": "\tQ3：第3四半期",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855563,
      "updated": 1786855569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8140a800000000008bab63",
      "text": "\t\t4月始まり企業なら10月〜12月",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855593,
      "updated": 1786855593
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81408a00000000008bab5f",
      "text": "\tQ4：第4四半期",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855563,
      "updated": 1786855570
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8140af00000000008bab64",
      "text": " \t4月始まり企業なら1月〜3月（本決算）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855600,
      "updated": 1786855600
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8142a100000000008bab77",
      "text": "\t企業によって発表日が異なる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856098,
      "updated": 1786856098
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8142a100000000008bab78",
      "text": "\t\tほぼ日どこかの企業が決算している",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856098,
      "updated": 1786856098
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8142a100000000008bab79",
      "text": "\t\t> [https://gyazo.com/fb2af2f7f09b6bc7cd6726a59fb4e2c0]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856098,
      "updated": 1786856098
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8142a100000000008bab7a",
      "text": "  > [https://www.sbisec.co.jp/ETGate/?_ControlID=WPLETmgR001Control&_PageID=WPLETmgR001Mdtl20&_DataStoreID=DSWPLETmgR001Control&_ActionID=DefaultAID&burl=iris_economicCalendar&cat1=market&cat2=economicCalender&dir=tl1-cal%7Ctl2-schedule%7Ctl3-stock%7Ctl4-calsel&file=index.html&getFlg=on 決算発表スケジュール（国内株式） | SBI 証券]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856098,
      "updated": 1786856098
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81408a00000000008bab60",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786855563,
      "updated": 1786855563
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81443800000000008bab7b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856505,
      "updated": 1786856505
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81444600000000008bab7c",
      "text": "権利確定日／権利落ち日[. [https://support.matsui.co.jp/faq/show/123?site_domain=faq 権利付最終日、権利落ち日、権利確定日とはなんですか。 | よくあるご質問（Q＆A）｜松井証券]]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856519,
      "updated": 1786856775
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81444700000000008bab7e",
      "text": "\t配当・株主優待・株式分割などの権利を得るための基準日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856520,
      "updated": 1786856527
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81445a00000000008bab7f",
      "text": "\t権利付き最終日：株主の権利*を取得することができる最終取引日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856539,
      "updated": 1786856688
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8144f100000000008bab87",
      "text": "\t\t株主の権利*：配当・株主優待・株式分割・株式無償交付等",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856690,
      "updated": 1786856698
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81445a00000000008bab80",
      "text": " 権利落ち日：株式を買付けても株主の権利を取得することができない日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856539,
      "updated": 1786856720
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8144cc00000000008bab86",
      "text": " 権利確定日：各企業が定める決算期末日や株主名簿を確定する日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856653,
      "updated": 1786856755
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81455400000000008bab8b",
      "text": " 権利割当日：株式分割に関する権利確定日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856788,
      "updated": 1786856814
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81445a00000000008bab81",
      "text": " 配当支払日：配当が実際に支払われる日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856539,
      "updated": 1786856875
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8145ab00000000008bab8d",
      "text": " \t権利確定日から2～3ヶ月後",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856875,
      "updated": 1786856892
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81446700000000008bab83",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786856552,
      "updated": 1786856552
    }
  ]
}